abstract: >-
  Synthetic proof-of-concept software for lot-aware predictive CPV analytics
  in tablet compression using tuned XGBoost, SHAP explainability, and an
  applicability-domain control. The package is intended for educational,
  portfolio, and research demonstration and is not validated for GMP use.
